+# Requirement accountability
+
+| User requirement | Outcome / location | Verification and unresolved issue |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Pursue another available public-source lead | New Alderson-attributed candidate preview; README and AV01 | Cover and scoped passage actually viewed. Native/custodian PDF and exact reviewed version remain TODO. |
+| Do not repeat completed searches | PROTOCOL-LOCAL records two previously unrun Alderson-specific queries and a newly inspected participant locator | Earlier failed clock/CD/WAV/host routes not retried; old20-minute participant account not counted as a new result or applied to held media. |
+| Preserve conflicting records and source links | AV02/AV04, SOURCES, README table | DRM1/DRM2 and all adopted time-like fields side by side; no repair, preferred value, date inference or offset. |
+| Test assumptions and retain contrary evidence | AV03 and README | Both copies retain common AA11/Langley content. Not independent corroboration; narrower allegedly omitted call untested. |
+| Exact file/page/line and reading scope | COMPARISON-PINS, READING-SCOPE | Viewer/internal/printed/Bates/reader line systems distinguished. Partial regions do not become whole-file reading or absence evidence. |
+| Preserve originals and provenance | Native-only two unedited JPEGs, SOURCES and SOURCE-CHECKS | Actual bytes/hash/readback. Browser representations are not native-PDF hashes. Prior sources unchanged. |
+| Missing inputs remain TODO; continue available work | OPEN-TODOS carries prior MC/MFR/OM and all18criteria | No input closed from this preview. Actual native pair, call join and redo still missing. No gated action bypass. |
+| Revision accountability and actual text diff | This checklist; TEXT-CHANGES.diff | New standalone derivative; actual Git addition diff against absence. Prior documents unchanged. Visual reading separate from text-diff verification. |
+| Commit/push eligible findings as AveLyra | Publication plan and remote receipts retained locally; exact final commit supplied after verification | Additive original research only, via documented helpers, verified account/destination/author/committer/ref and file bytes. No raw source/private payload. Not claimed complete before remote verification. |
+| Keep technical work/coordination separate | README/TODOs | Operational source acquisition here; calibrated recorder/materials work remains assigned elsewhere. Overview handoff only after verified meaningful publication. |
+
+The list of findings is not a count or percentage of evidence for wrongdoing. Source overlap, source labels and a missing correction worksheet do not establish conspiracy, deliberate suppression, motive or causation.
